❮ Java Keywords

Thethrowkeyword is used to create a custom error.

Thethrowstatement is used together with anexception type. There are many exception types available in Java:ArithmeticException,ClassNotFoundException,ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException,SecurityException, etc.

The exception type is often used together with a custommethod, like in the example above.

